; EXODUS.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; CMDTAB: tables of the combat commands (84DB-888B).
;
; Data only, used by COMBAT, DUNEVENT and DUNMOVE: the four combat variables (HitTile,
; CombatPlayer, FoeTile, KillSpellUsed at 84E0-84E3), the picture and combat map file names,
; the combat command table (CombatKeys / CombatCmds), the fountain effects, the foes' hit point
; and experience tables, the class-to-tile table and the strings of the dungeon events and of
; the fight.
CODE SEGMENT BYTE PUBLIC
ASSUME CS:CODE, DS:CODE, ES:CODE, SS:CODE
EXTRN CCmdNorth:NEAR
EXTRN CCmdSouth:NEAR
EXTRN CCmdEast:NEAR
EXTRN CCmdWest:NEAR
EXTRN CCmdVolume:NEAR
EXTRN CCmdReady:NEAR
EXTRN CCmdZtats:NEAR
